# FABLE-SONNET-ADDRESS-TICKETS-20260922-97 Ticket A c.* door fixture.
#
# A genuinely foreign C type in address-slot position is spelled through
# the same raw c.* door as everywhere else in L2 (author correction,
# 2026-09-22): l2_ptr_local_ty strips the "c." marker (L2's own namespace
# prefix, never part of the C identifier) before interning, so this must
# lower to the identical C declaration a bare `@: FILE f` already produces.
fn: main () int
    @: c.FILE f
    return: 0
end: main
